<p id="supplier-demo-csv-help">Required headers, in any order: <code>${CSV_REQUIRED_COLUMNS2.join(", ")}</code>. Exact names only; no extra columns, automatic mapping, trimming, date/currency conversion or guessed matches. Use real ISO dates and positive integer minor-unit amounts without signs, spaces, leading zeros or decimals. Record IDs and references keep their leading zeros and Unicode. Quoted commas and escaped double quotes are supported. The as-of date does not prove export freshness or completeness.</p>
