    does: "You add employees with an annual allowance and carried-over days, then requests arrive as vacation, sick, unpaid or parental, full day or half day, inclusive dates. Approve or reject with a reason, re-open a rejected one by approving it, and cancel via leave_reject with a reason. leave_balance is derived on the call (allowance plus carry-over minus approved and pending, rounded down to whole days plus a half day), leave_out_range answers who is out for coverage and calendars with pending counted as a plan, and the import and ICS export move the ledger in and out. EMP and LV numbers are sequential and never reissued.",
    prompts: [
