    measured: "The contract suite drives the nine tools over real stdio: the fourth active agreement is refused and nothing is written, expiring one frees the slot, the clause texts and HTML rendering refuse free-tier calls with the tagged upgrade link, and a draft cannot jump straight to signed. The only files written are agreements.json and counter.json."
